{
  "slug": "outbound-signals",
  "name": "Outbound Signals",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Intent signals CLI: monitor buying signals, discover leads matching your ICP, and enroll them into outbound campaigns. Powered by the Signals API.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `max-leads` (Discover and manage leads from intent signals — list discovered leads, enroll them into Overloop campaigns, and set…), `max-monitor` (Set up and manage intent signal monitoring — create businesses with ICP, subscribe to signal types, and manage…)\n- **Agents** (1): `signal-hunter` (Specialized agent for setting up intent signal monitoring and harvesting leads)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install outbound-signals@claude-community` from `sortlist/signals-cli`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1
  },
